pack hardening
├── when a pack manifest references paths outside its directory
│   └── it refuses to load
├── when a pack file is a symlink escaping the pack
│   ├── it refuses to load
│   └── it refuses a symlinked manifest
├── when a pack name is not a single path component
│   └── it refuses to load
├── when a target pattern is not reversible
│   └── it refuses to load
├── when a manifest contains unknown fields
│   └── it refuses to load
└── when a project pack shadows a builtin name
    └── it is bypassed by the builtin loader
